Version 1.2.2
- Fixed the JSON output, which relied on behaviour of nlohmann_json that is
  only present in version 3.11 and up; nlohmann_json 3.11 is now required
- Validate the --output-format option
- Parse the auth seq id numerically in the JSON output instead of using stoi
- Generate the revision header in the build directory instead of the source tree
- Removed the pdb_redo::force_link hack, now handled by libcifpp
- Versioned the version info registry and dropped noexcept from its constructors
- Only construct the structure when the input mmCIF file is not empty
- Raise an error when the output file cannot be opened
- Marked the mcfp and pdb-redo dependencies as required
- Synced the README and man page with the actual command line options
- Added missing standard library includes
- Various fixes to the GitHub Actions workflow

Version 1.2.1
- Modfied tests required by changes in libpdb-redo

Version 1.2.0
- Based on libpdb-redo 3.3.1 which contains a fix for EDIA
  and OPIA calculation.

Version 1.1.4
- New dependency on libpdb-redo, replacing libnewuoa with gsl

Version 1.1.3
- New cmake file, fetching dependencies automatically
- replaced libzeep with nlohmann_json

Version 1.1.2
- Replace boost test with Catch2
- Fix incorrect include of mcfp.hpp

Version 1.1.1
- Update libmcfp dependency

Version 1.1.0
- Changed command line arguments for loading dictionaries
  containing chemical compound information in either
  CCD format or restraint format.

Version 1.0.12
- Changed testing to use minimal CCD

Version 1.0.11
- Changes required to build on Windows

